.SH 
=================================[[ common header ]]=================================

.SH NAME
koios \- provides a universal unit-testing framework for writing scripts

.SH PATRON (see HERITAGE at bottom for more)
koios-polos (axis of heaven) titan of intelligence, curiosity, and farsight

.SH IMAGERY
northern star around which all the other consellations revolve

.SH SUMMARY
koios is a meta-language, related parser, and c-language generator to simplify,
standardize, and make executable unit-tests for c-language programs.  it is
integrated with yUNIT, yVAR, and ouroborus (on a system-wide basis).

.SH DISCLAIMER, CAVEAT, and SERIOUS FOREWARNING
i am a crazy, selfish, dog-fooding c-programmer. my code tends to be
experimental and constantly evolving. my point is NOT to be the best, it is to
challenge myself, build from scratch, and allow fast problem solving.

use this freely to learn, laugh, and make your own.  i don't encourage or
make any concessions for users, i optimized for myself.  please, don't just
use or copy this, build it better yourself and increase your skills ;)

